# Extract's own Pass B fixture (U6a.2-4a), not a ladder rung: the call hazards the ladder does not hold
# yet (ladder README, "Not on the ladder yet": decorators, REACHING_DEF, builtin targets). Written by hand
# from ws/ in the ladder's format (fixtures/ladder/README.md) and checked by
# packages/extract/src/ladder.test.ts. It is the file's whole code tier as extract emits it; SOURCE_FILE
# is the engine's (C-EXTRACT Q8). It holds no import (IMPORT is BMO-134).
#
# calls.py: a module MEMBER and its redefinition (REACHING_DEF takes the last one before the region,
# "last match wins"); a nested def whose call is not descended (decision 92); a forward reference
# (`compute` is called above its def: Pass A completes the file before Pass B, I21); builtin targets
# (`print`, `len`, `str`: CALLS status external to the adapter's builtin table, I11); a decorator on a
# function and on a method (CALL kind decorator, counted in $root: the region is the enclosing METHOD or
# $root, decision 92); a lambda whose call counts in its METHOD; a local variable called (no CALLS, no
# SYMBOL, I11); a receiver call (no CALLS: resolveCallee is gone); a constructor call (the class, ?Q4);
# a class member's initializer and module statements, all in $root in source order.
#
# CALL ordinals per region, pre-order (decision 92):
#   $root: @trace (22) 0, compute(RATE) in Box (29) 1, @trace on grow (31) 2, scale(RATE) (37) 3, print (38) 4
#   scale: compute 0, print 1, later 2;  compute: len 0, str 1;  later: scale 0, run 1;  Box.grow: resize 0, Box 1
# REACHING_DEF (archive rules): a bare-name argument (or a keyword argument's bare value) reaches its CALL
# from the region METHOD's PARAM, else from the last module MEMBER of that name declared before the
# region; a name the region assigns locally (`total`, `run`) reaches nothing.

